  "name": "Baked Salmon Steaks",
  "subtitle": "Herb-seasoned salmon with spinach and Parmesan",
  "description": "Salmon steaks are coated with olive oil, seasoned with savory spices, layered with herbs, spinach, and Parmesan, then baked until tender and fully cooked.",
